  "releaseNotes": "Full release notes: https://github.com/rafalka/MauiSkiaUi/blob/v1.0.0-Prerelease13/CHANGELOG.md#100-prerelease13\n\nNew features\n- Drawn text input (Phase D)\n- Stepper (D7)\n- Pointer buttons\n- Input formatters (D9)\n- Leading and trailing views (D11)\n- Validation chrome (D10)\n- Android autofill (D14)\n- VoiceOver text navigation in drawn text fields (D6)\n- Numeric entry (D16)\n\nBreaking changes\n- SkUiPickerClearButtonPaint is now SkUiClearButtonPaint: the picker's and the drawn text fields' clear buttons share it (DrawPickerClearButton, DrawTextFieldClearButton). Painters that name the type rename it; lambdas that infer it need no change.",
